msgid "attachments.vision_unsupported"
msgid_plural "attachments.vision_unsupported#plural"
msgstr[0] ""
"当前模型配置“{label}”不支持图像输入。\n"
"\n"
"请在“模型”中启用“视觉模型”，或切换到多模态配置后重新发送消息。\n"
"\n"
"未附加的图像：\n"
"{files}"

#. English: The active model profile does not support image input.  Enable
#. "Vision Model" in Models, or switch to a multimodal profile and send the
#. message again.  Image not attached: {files}
#. English-plural: The active model profile does not support image input.
