#. English: {message} {hint}
#. chrys-meta={"fingerprint":"2915288bdaf397f8a07684a40dfd5a081efc73c131b2a6bc33225423748ec73c","multiline":false,"placeholders":["hint","message"]}
#: src/chrys/foundation/errors/display.py
