#. English: Claude models on the Anthropic protocol cache a prompt only when
#. the request asks for it, and this profile doesn't. Without caching, every
#. model call pays full price for the whole conversation again.  Add and Save
#. puts {option} into the extra_body chat option. Reading from the cache costs
#. a tenth of the normal input price or less; writing to it costs 25% more. If
#. your endpoint rejects the field, remove it from extra_body.
#. chrys-meta={"fingerprint":"eaab5d15caa54a4472be84df6c8fad6500ea83f2fd8efecbba5e26c72e924318","multiline":true,"placeholders":["option"]}
#: src/chrys/app/tui/screens/dialogs/prompt_cache.py
msgid "tui.prompt_cache.message"
msgstr ""
"Anthropic 协议下的 Claude 模型只在请求要求时才缓存提示词，而此配置没有要求。不开启缓存，每次模型调用都要为整段对话重新按全价计费。\n"
"\n"
"“添加并保存”会把 {option} 加入 extra_body Chat 选项。从缓存读取的费用为正常输入价格的十分之一或更低；写入缓存则贵 25%。如果你的端点不接受该字段，请从 extra_body 中删除它。"

