msgstr "留空 = {default}。会话存放在 <root>/sessions 下。"

#. English: Close the theme editor before changing the applied theme.
#. chrys-meta={"fingerprint":"1cc7db84f1dacf4388f0476c6e0803ebe6a5ff92fbccd58479f4e1687506754d","multiline":false,"placeholders":[]}
#: src/chrys/app/tui/screens/settings/dialog.py
